<PolicyLayout title="Support" description="Installation help, billing questions, data exports and problem reports.">
 <p>Start with the <a href="https://blogstack-docs.hidden-silence-2d18.workers.dev/docs/quickstart">Next.js installation guide</a> and <a href="https://blogstack-docs.hidden-silence-2d18.workers.dev/docs/plans">subscription documentation</a>.</p>
 <p>For a problem report, include your project slug, the action you attempted, the time and any request ID shown with the error. Send private details only to support; never include API-key secrets, passwords or verification links.</p>
 <p>For charges and refunds, include your account email and order ID. For data access or deletion, use the account email so we can verify ownership.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
